Package: trailer
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqpdf29 | libqpdf32, libgl1, libglib2.0-0
Maintainer: Trailer Contributors <TODO@trailer.example.com>
Description: Cross-platform PDF and image workbench
 Trailer is a fast, cross-platform viewer for PDF documents and images.
 .
 Supports PDF, PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF, TIFF, WebP, and portable image formats.
